{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34287","headline":"村中晚望 · 陆龟蒙","name":"村中晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱杖柴门立，江村日易斜。\n鴈寒犹忆侣，人病更离家。\n短鬓看成雪，双眸旧有花。\n何须万里外，即此是天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「村中晚望」条，撰者郭扬波、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"郭扬波"}